---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
---

<Base title="About">
  <article class="prose max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold">How it works</h1>
    <p class="mt-3">
      ExpertTranslateAI runs entirely in your browser. Your text is sent straight to
      <a href="https://openrouter.ai" class="text-accent">
        OpenRouter
      </a>{' '}
      with an API key that you own and that is stored only on this device. There is no server in
      between.
    </p>
    <h2 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold">Pipeline</h2>
    <p class="mt-2">
      Long texts are split into balanced chunks. Each chunk is translated with the whole document as
      context so terminology stays consistent. Code, URLs and placeholders are protected before
      translation and restored after. Later versions add multi-model translation, review, judging,
      glossaries and translation memory.
    </p>
    <h2 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold">Privacy and your key</h2>
    <ul class="mt-2 list-disc pl-5">
      <li>
        The key is kept in this browser's local storage. Anyone with access to this browser profile
        can use it.
      </li>
      <li>Set a spending limit on the key in your OpenRouter dashboard.</li>
      <li>Use "Forget key" in Settings to remove it at any time.</li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</Base>
